<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/lu_2b6290b9ec9e0199863d75426f4eb32800b1dbc4c89274d4f3da3dea703a1dad_n0035/tu_0006> <http://digistrucmed.org/verbatimText> "It is recommended that when amiodarone therapy is initiated, the potential for interactions with other drugs be reviewed. The maintenance doses of digoxin, warfarin, and some statins should be reduced when amiodarone is initiated and then carefully monitored. Adjustment in doses of these drugs and laboratory assessment of drug activity or serum concentration after initiation of amiodarone is recommended. (Strength of Evidence = A)" .
<http://digistrucmed.org/entity-mention/lu_2b6290b9ec9e0199863d75426f4eb32800b1dbc4c89274d4f3da3dea703a1dad_n0035/e_0023/normalization> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://digistrucmed.org/EntityNormalization> .
