<http://digistrucmed.org/ClassOfRecommendation_2a> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "2a" .
<http://digistrucmed.org/normative-assertion/lu_2b6290b9ec9e0199863d75426f4eb32800b1dbc4c89274d4f3da3dea703a1dad_n0035/na_0004> <http://digistrucmed.org/notes> "Amiodarone may be considered to reduce recurrent symptomatic arrhythmias that cause ICD shocks." .
